<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17820" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Faustus</span></b> . <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A surname of</i> L. Cornelius Sulla, <i>the son of the dictator</i>, also called
			 Faustus Sulla, <i><span class="en">Cic. Clu.
				34, 94</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Sull. 19, 54</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Vatin.
				13, 32</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Agr. 1, 4, 12</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Att. 9,
				1, 4</span></i>; <i><span class="en">9, 11, 4</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Caes. B. C. 1,
				6</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b> Deriv.: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Faustĭānus</span></b> , a, um,
				adj., <i>of</i> or <i>belonging to Faustus Sulla</i>, <i>Faustian</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ager, that produced excellent wine,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					14, 6, 8, § 62</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vina,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Front. Fer. Als. 3</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Fem.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Fausta</span></b> , ae, <i>daughter of</i>
			Sulla, <i>wife of</i> Milo, <i><span class="en">Cic. Att. 5,
				8, 2</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>III.</b>
			<i>A poor tragedian</i>, <i><span class="en">Juv. 7,
			12</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
